      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meridian%2C_Mississippi",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Meridian’s Carnegie Library, opened in 1912, now houses the Meridian Museum of Art, a cultural hub for the city.",
